# After the Today view was reordered, a task Quick Add dates today joins the list at the end even though the inbox comes first in the file.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
END
keys gt j <A-k>
see ▌ - Review PRs  Work
keys q
type Call mom today
keys <Enter>
see - Call mom  INBOX
keys G x
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call mom @start({today}) @done({today})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
END
